---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { absoluteUrl, buildBreadcrumbSchema, pageSeo } from '../../lib/seo';

const metadata = pageSeo.mechanics;
const schema = [
  { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'CollectionPage', name: metadata.h1, description: metadata.description, url: absoluteUrl(metadata.canonicalPath) },
  buildBreadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Greedy Growers Hub', path: '/' }, { name: 'Mechanics', path: metadata.canonicalPath }]),
];
---

<BaseLayout title={metadata.title} description={metadata.description} canonicalPath={metadata.canonicalPath} schema={schema}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <header class="max-w-4xl"><p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-leaf-400">Understand the decision loop</p><h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.04em] sm:text-6xl">{metadata.h1}</h1><p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-sand-300">Greedy Growers decisions connect three systems: how long you wait, what lightning can do, and how mutations may change value. Each guide separates matched reports from official facts and open questions.</p></header>

    <section class="mt-16" aria-label="Greedy Growers mechanics map">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-leaf-400">Mechanics map</p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Start with the question blocking your next run. Timing is a bankroll decision, lightning is a risk mechanism, and mutations are a value-modifier system.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <a href="/mechanics/when-to-harvest/" class="rounded-2xl border border-leaf-500/35 bg-leaf-500/[.045] p-7 no-underline hover:border-leaf-500/70"><p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-leaf-400">Decision strategy</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-white">When to Harvest — Strategy and Break-Even Timing</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Choose conservative, balanced, or maximum-greed timing and calculate recovery after failed runs.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-leaf-400">Compare timing strategies →</span></a>
        <a href="/mechanics/lightning/" class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-7 no-underline hover:border-leaf-500/50"><p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-leaf-400">Risk mechanism</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Lightning — Confirmed Facts and Risk Signals</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">See what the official loop confirms and which odds, warnings, and thresholds remain unverified.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-leaf-400">Review lightning evidence →</span></a>
        <a href="/mechanics/mutations/" class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-7 no-underline hover:border-leaf-500/50"><p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-leaf-400">Value modifiers</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Mutations — Multipliers, Weather, and Evidence</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Compare six reported Update 1.2 multipliers, their weather or lightning triggers, and stacking limits.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-bold text-leaf-400">Open mutation table →</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3" aria-label="Mechanics questions"><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Should I keep waiting?</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Use your coin reserve, target return, and failed-run recovery line—not a universal harvest percentage.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Can lightning change this run?</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Separate the official existence of lightning risk from unverified odds, timers, and mutation conditions.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-ink-900 p-6"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Does a mutation guarantee profit?</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">No. A reported multiplier does not remove seed cost, exposure time, or the loss from failed attempts.</p></article></section>

    <aside class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-amber-400/25 bg-amber-300/[.06] p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-100">Why the calculator does not auto-apply mutation multipliers</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-6 text-sand-300">Two current guides agree on individual mutation values, but the combined stacking formula is not source-matched or gameplay-verified. Enter the final value observed in your server so the calculator does not turn an unverified formula into a confident answer.</p></aside>

    <nav class="mt-14 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/" class="rounded-md bg-leaf-500 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-ink-950 no-underline">Open the Calculator</a><a href="/seeds/list/" class="rounded-md border border-leaf-500/35 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-leaf-400 no-underline">Search all seeds</a><a href="/updates/" class="rounded-md border border-line px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white no-underline">Check update status</a></nav>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
